{"schemaVersion":1,"id":51,"sections":[{"id":"118004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1720],"start":0,"count":31},{"id":"118004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11710],"start":31,"count":22},{"id":"118005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1730],"start":53,"count":29},{"id":"118005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11720],"start":82,"count":33},{"id":"118006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1740],"start":115,"count":28},{"id":"118006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11730],"start":143,"count":19}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:2","scriptId":1720,"text":"波西娅博士从吉普车上跳下来，走到了我们面前。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:3","scriptId":1720,"text":"她扫了一眼周围的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:4","scriptId":1720,"text":"“看上去还不错嘛，已经抓到几只了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:5","scriptId":1720,"text":"“一般的麻醉弹要打入战车兽体内太费劲了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:6","scriptId":1720,"text":"“那是肯定的，不然我也不会专门研制这个麻醉穿甲弹了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:7","scriptId":1720,"text":"波西娅用手指了指背后的吉普车，上面堆积了不少弹药箱。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":593,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:8","scriptId":1720,"text":"“有这个怎么不早拿出来啊！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:9","scriptId":1720,"text":"“贵人多忘事不是挺正常的嘛～虽然这次是我的问题，不过你这口气我可不喜欢，对我说话最好客气点，要不然……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:10","scriptId":1720,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":589,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:11","scriptId":1720,"text":"“既然波西娅博士已经来了，那么可以马上转入战车兽捕捉了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:12","scriptId":1720,"text":"“恩，应该没什么问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:13","scriptId":1720,"text":"“东西已经送到了，我该走了，你们加油。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:14","scriptId":1720,"text":"“啊……那个既然波西娅博士来都来了的话，给我们演示一下看看吧，这个麻醉穿甲弹的效力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:15","scriptId":1720,"text":"听到这话，波西娅停下了脚步，转过身来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:16","scriptId":1720,"text":"“也好，之前都是在实验室做的测试，我看看实战中的效果如何。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:17","scriptId":1720,"text":"（喂喂，还真是测试用品啊……我就随口说说罢了……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:18","scriptId":1720,"text":"波西娅从特制的弹药箱中拿出一枚标有黄色闪电图案的炮弹，填到了自己的炮膛内。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:19","scriptId":1720,"text":"“那么，战车兽在哪里，找几个出来让我试试手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:20","scriptId":1720,"text":"佩妮掏出望远镜，对四周进行巡视。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:21","scriptId":1720,"text":"“我看看……我们的左前方一千米左右有两只战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:22","scriptId":1720,"text":"“恩，很好，看我的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:23","scriptId":1720,"text":"只听“轰隆”一声巨响，波西娅朝着目标开炮了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:24","scriptId":1720,"text":"炮弹呼啸着飞向目标，随后炸裂开，溅起了大量的尘土。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:25","scriptId":1720,"text":"“那个……结果如何？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:26","scriptId":1720,"text":"“未命中。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":593,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:27","scriptId":1720,"text":"“着弹点太靠前，未能命中目标，而且现在那些战车兽朝我们冲过来了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":596,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:28","scriptId":1720,"text":"“啊……小失误，大家不用在意～欸嘿～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:29","scriptId":1720,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:30","scriptId":1720,"text":"“先别管那么多了，迎敌吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":572,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:31","scriptId":1720,"text":"“等等，让我再来一炮挽回刚才的失态！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":572,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-PROLOGUE:1720:32","scriptId":1720,"text":"“那您也上吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:1","scriptId":11710,"text":"（看了下整场战斗，波西娅的战斗能力也就平均水准以上吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:2","scriptId":11710,"text":"（不过研究者也不是个个都像索菲亚教官那样出众的吧。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:3","scriptId":11710,"text":"“你一个人在那里想什么呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:4","scriptId":11710,"text":"突然从背后传来了波西娅的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:5","scriptId":11710,"text":"“啊，没什么……只是在想怎么把这些麻醉状态的战车兽弄回去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:6","scriptId":11710,"text":"“这是你们该考虑了，和我无关。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:7","scriptId":11710,"text":"“把这些战车兽运回死水的话，你们的任务就完成了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:8","scriptId":11710,"text":"“好了，我也该走了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:9","scriptId":11710,"text":"说罢，波西娅就一个人自顾自地坐上来时的吉普车，疾驰而去……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:10","scriptId":11710,"text":"“啊……就这么走掉了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:11","scriptId":11710,"text":"“嘛，至少在战斗的时候还帮了我们一把。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:12","scriptId":11710,"text":"“那种程度的战斗能力随处可见啊，不过波西娅的舞装比我们要强上不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:13","scriptId":11710,"text":"“那也是没办法的事啦～波尔舍的大小姐呗，她身上那套舞装就是她自己开发的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:14","scriptId":11710,"text":"“啊……波尔舍，原来是这样……波西娅·波尔舍。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:15","scriptId":11710,"text":"“波尔舍舞装集团每次对外公布新科研成果的时候都会出现在人员名单上，我终于想起来哪见过这个名字了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:16","scriptId":11710,"text":"“哼，那就是说她是个财大气粗的娇蛮大小姐咯？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:17","scriptId":11710,"text":"“呃……虽然性格上确实有点瑕疵……不过作为波尔舍的骨干研发人员，我相信波西娅肯定有很多过人之处的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":591,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:18","scriptId":11710,"text":"“哦呀～听到波尔舍的名号以后对她的评价就一下子变高的嘛～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:19","scriptId":11710,"text":"“有吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:20","scriptId":11710,"text":"“有。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:21","scriptId":11710,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118004-EPILOGUE:11710:22","scriptId":11710,"text":"“好了，闲话不多说，开始想办法把这些战车兽运回死水吧。我去联络下运输队。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-14.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:2","scriptId":1730,"text":"用了两天时间，终于顺利地把被麻醉的战车兽运回了死水，不过没想到运输队也要付钱……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":620,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:3","scriptId":1730,"text":"“货物已经运到，运费的话，每头战车兽一万运费～","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":596,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:4","scriptId":1730,"text":"“诶？是按战车兽的数量算运费的？不是按车辆算的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":628,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:5","scriptId":1730,"text":"“这可是大件货物，按件数记不是很正常吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":628,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:6","scriptId":1730,"text":"“呃……能不能便宜点，毕竟我们这次可是运了二十头。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":628,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":620,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:7","scriptId":1730,"text":"“那么这次算你便宜点，8000一头吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:8","scriptId":1730,"text":"“能不能5000？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":620,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:9","scriptId":1730,"text":"“真是的，作为一介指挥官竟然还计较这些小钱，真是不干脆啊，我这边一口价7000，不能再低了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:10","scriptId":1730,"text":"“那就7000吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":620,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:11","scriptId":1730,"text":"“OK～那么就这样，我让车队把战车兽运进基地实验室了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:12","scriptId":1730,"text":"“那就拜托您了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":620,"speaker":"沃莉丝·普尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:13","scriptId":1730,"text":"“哪里，小事一桩～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":620,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:15","scriptId":1730,"text":"告别了运输小队负责人，我们准备动身向波西娅报告。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:16","scriptId":1730,"text":"“恩，完成的不错，报告书放桌上吧，之后我会签字的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:18","scriptId":1730,"text":"来到波西娅的研究室，和第一次来这里的时候一样，波西娅正在一边观察培养皿一边快速的记下数据。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:19","scriptId":1730,"text":"“好的，那么我们就先告辞了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:20","scriptId":1730,"text":"正当我们准备退出研究室的时候，被波西娅叫住了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:21","scriptId":1730,"text":"“等等，我听说你和索菲亚教授很熟啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:22","scriptId":1730,"text":"“是的……有什么问题吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:23","scriptId":1730,"text":"“索菲亚教授那边出了什么问题对吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:24","scriptId":1730,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:25","scriptId":1730,"text":"“消息真是灵通。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:26","scriptId":1730,"text":"“哼，这点程度谈不上灵通，只不过是翻了翻关于你的资料而已。毕竟你也是我重要的观察对象啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:27","scriptId":1730,"text":"“呃，不要解剖的话，其他的都好说……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:28","scriptId":1730,"text":"“那种玩笑别当真啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:29","scriptId":1730,"text":"（那时听上去可一点也不像玩笑啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:30","scriptId":1730,"text":"“那么能跟我具体说一下吗？我挺有兴趣知道的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:31","scriptId":1730,"text":"“好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-PROLOGUE:1730:32","scriptId":1730,"text":"（教官真不愧是风云人物，走到哪儿都有人想知道关于她的事情……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:1","scriptId":11720,"text":"把从齐格菲研究所到伏龙芝受袭的大致情况告诉给了波西娅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:2","scriptId":11720,"text":"“恩，该说的都说完了，我能冒昧的问一下波西娅博士的看法吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:3","scriptId":11720,"text":"只看见波西娅脸上蒙上了一层阴霾，神情非常凝重，就好像我说了什么非常重大的事情一样。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":4,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:4","scriptId":11720,"text":"“人形战车兽之前就有所耳闻，但是就像都市传说一样的东西，我是有所耳闻，但并没有放在心上……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:5","scriptId":11720,"text":"说到这里，只见波西娅的身躯开始颤抖，声音也因此而变得有些不稳。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:6","scriptId":11720,"text":"“那个……波西娅博士，您不要紧吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:7","scriptId":11720,"text":"“啊哈哈，哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:8","scriptId":11720,"text":"突然波西娅毫无征兆地大笑了起来，一时间在场的所有人都被这一景象吓得怔住了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:9","scriptId":11720,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":591,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":579,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:10","scriptId":11720,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":591,"right":579,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:11","scriptId":11720,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":591,"right":596,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:12","scriptId":11720,"text":"“博士！？波西娅博士？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:13","scriptId":11720,"text":"大概是听到了我的呼喊，波西娅的笑声很快收敛了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:14","scriptId":11720,"text":"“哈哈，好久没有让我那么兴奋的事情了，这简直比发现新大陆还刺激啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:15","scriptId":11720,"text":"“您的意思是……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:16","scriptId":11720,"text":"“你们不但接触到了那些人形生物，还弄到了珍贵的样本！！虽然最后样本丢失这点我非常不爽……不过具体问题可以问索菲亚教授！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:17","scriptId":11720,"text":"“所以特勤局那边快速控制了索菲亚教授，我觉得也在情理之中。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:18","scriptId":11720,"text":"“就是说兴师问罪都只是借口而已？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:19","scriptId":11720,"text":"“这不是很明显的吗？虽然不知道联盟上层在打什么小算盘，但是显而易见的一点是他们想从索菲亚教授那里得到什么。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:20","scriptId":11720,"text":"“索菲亚教官她照实说不就行了吗？对上层隐瞒这种事情也不会有什么好处啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:21","scriptId":11720,"text":"“是吗？我倒不这么认为，我是一直觉得特勤局上层有问题的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:22","scriptId":11720,"text":"“呃……这种问题发言真的好吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:23","scriptId":11720,"text":"“哈？？这里可是死水！！你最好快点把思路给我转过来，胜利女神特勤局只不过是打着钢舞姬的旗号合法接受全球资源的组织而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:24","scriptId":11720,"text":"“这里对特勤局抱有疑问或不满的人比比皆是，特勤局是绝对正确的这种想法最好现在就给我从脑袋里彻底抹消。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:25","scriptId":11720,"text":"“好的……我会铭记在心……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:26","scriptId":11720,"text":"“我很宽宏大量的～不会和你这种新人计较的啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:27","scriptId":11720,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:28","scriptId":11720,"text":"“那么，接下来我想问的问题都集中在索菲亚教授身上了……得想办法见到她本人。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:29","scriptId":11720,"text":"“你有没有什么好办法？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:30","scriptId":11720,"text":"“没有……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:31","scriptId":11720,"text":"“真是不中用的家伙……好了，你们可以退下了，报酬的事情我会通知芮蓓支付给你们的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:32","scriptId":11720,"text":"“……好的，那么接下来就拜托您了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118005-EPILOGUE:11720:33","scriptId":11720,"text":"波西娅甩甩手，示意可以散了，于是我们就准备先回任务前台领取报酬。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:2","scriptId":1740,"text":"回到了任务前台，准备领取报酬。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:3","scriptId":1740,"text":"“是申领报酬对吗？波西娅博士已经联络过我了，那么请给我一下您的死水卡。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":608,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:4","scriptId":1740,"text":"“哦，好的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:5","scriptId":1740,"text":"不过在口袋里找了半天，都没找到。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":4,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:6","scriptId":1740,"text":"“长官，你不会是把死水卡丢了吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":589,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:7","scriptId":1740,"text":"“那东西丢了话，补办可以非常麻烦的哟。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":589,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:8","scriptId":1740,"text":"死水卡是在我加入死水佣兵团当天，蕾贝卡一起交付给我的东西之一。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":589,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:9","scriptId":1740,"text":"因为死水卡可以在全世界所有的银行进行货币交易，所以非常珍贵，同时也是证明自己是死水佣兵的一种凭证。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":589,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:10","scriptId":1740,"text":"芮蓓看看我，随后从前台的抽屉里找出了一份纸质的文件。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":589,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:11","scriptId":1740,"text":"“补办手续的话，请提交这个数字的手续费给我～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:12","scriptId":1740,"text":"芮蓓指了指上面的费用栏。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":578,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:13","scriptId":1740,"text":"“什么？？那这次岂不是白干了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:14","scriptId":1740,"text":"就在这时，从一开始就站在角落的维卡慢悠悠地走过来，扯了一下我的衣角。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:15","scriptId":1740,"text":"“维卡？怎么了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:16","scriptId":1740,"text":"“给。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:17","scriptId":1740,"text":"维卡手里拿着的正是我在找的死水卡。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:18","scriptId":1740,"text":"“诶？为什么我的卡在你那里？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:19","scriptId":1740,"text":"“清理战场时捡到的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:20","scriptId":1740,"text":"“真是帮大忙了，谢谢！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:21","scriptId":1740,"text":"看到这里，芮蓓默默地把文件收回了抽屉。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:22","scriptId":1740,"text":"“既然已经找回了死水卡，那么就交给我吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:23","scriptId":1740,"text":"接着，芮蓓把我们全队的死水卡都收走了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:24","scriptId":1740,"text":"“这次的报酬总共一百万，扣除运费十四万，总计八十六万。均分是吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:25","scriptId":1740,"text":"“对，均分。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:26","scriptId":1740,"text":"“那么每人二十一万五千，已经添加入你们的账户，注意查收。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:28","scriptId":1740,"text":"告别了芮蓓以后，我们小队暂时解散，大家都回各自的寝室休息去了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:29","scriptId":1740,"text":"“终于可以睡软床了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"118006-PROLOGUE:1740:30","scriptId":1740,"text":"（队员的实力都不错，再磨合一段时间以后应该能开始接比较困难的任务了吧。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:1","scriptId":11730,"text":"某地——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:2","scriptId":11730,"text":"“本队那边出了点小状况，不过应该也用不了太久，她们会先派一名上位来进行督察。那么问题来了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:3","scriptId":11730,"text":"“兰布达，你为上位大人们的义体准备好了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":null,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:4","scriptId":11730,"text":"“还没有完成，你这边的时间期限呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:5","scriptId":11730,"text":"“……是我问你，不是你问我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:6","scriptId":11730,"text":"“至少一年。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:7","scriptId":11730,"text":"“不行，时间太久，最多只能给你四个月。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:8","scriptId":11730,"text":"“如果只是一具的话，四个月说不定来得及……只是我要使用的是钢舞姬义体。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:9","scriptId":11730,"text":"“哦？钢舞姬义体？说来听听。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:10","scriptId":11730,"text":"“我模拟钢舞姬的外部身体和战车兽的内核结构，制作了一具强度和外观都比较符合要求的义体，但是……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:11","scriptId":11730,"text":"“但是？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:12","scriptId":11730,"text":"“目前这具义体还有很多欠缺，毕竟钢舞姬是人类通过战车兽技术开发出来的残次品，下等种族开发的技术我还没仔细研究过。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:13","scriptId":11730,"text":"“所以需要开发钢舞姬的专家进行一些技术支持，这样的话可能还赶得上。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:14","scriptId":11730,"text":"“那么说……你是要人类来支援？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:15","scriptId":11730,"text":"“哼！时间不是那么紧迫的话，完全不需要。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:16","scriptId":11730,"text":"“好吧，我知道了，那你接下来的打算呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:17","scriptId":11730,"text":"“我已经有目标了，有我的传送能力，绑一个专家是轻而易举的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:18","scriptId":11730,"text":"“很好，那把具体的计划说一下，看看我有什么可以帮到你的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"118006-EPILOGUE:11730:19","scriptId":11730,"text":"“恩……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
